-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
System emoji names
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
At runtime OpenReaction reads emoji names from the macOS CoreEmoji framework's
resources on the user's own Mac. Those files are not included in, copied into,
or distributed with this repository or the app.

